# Docker build-context exclusions for the HuggingFace Space image.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything in the build context lands
# in the image. The deployed dashboard NEEDS the runtime data
# (`data/raw/`, `data/lake/`) — those are intentionally NOT excluded.
#
# What we DO exclude:
#   - data/eval/  — the anomalies answer key. It must NEVER reach the
#     Space/agents (it's the eval ground truth). Belt-and-suspenders on
#     top of .gitignore so it can't ride in regardless of how the Space
#     repo was populated.
#   - build/test cruft that bloats the image and is never needed at runtime.

data/eval/

# Python / build cruft
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# VCS + local
.git/
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.env

# Plans / scratch
*.log
